# Single-page app fallback.
#
# Expo Router owns routes like /:clinic/appointments/:id, which exist only in
# the client. Without this, a hard refresh or a shared deep link asks
# Cloudflare Pages for a file that was never built and gets a 404 — the app
# would only work when entered through /.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 301/302: the browser keeps the original URL so the
# router can still read the route it was asked for.
/*    /index.html    200
